-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/12: תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנה"ל תשע"ב
-- The recuperation allowance (havraa) and the jubilee grant for school year
-- 2011/12: the day price, the days table, pro-rating by position and between
-- employers, the position limits by reform (140%, 130%, 125%), and who is
-- owed the jubilee grant (25 or 30 years, by stage) and how much.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/12 תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנה"ל תשע"ב`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (24.6.2012) and addressee; no rule.

-- The corpus publishes the jubilee grant's clarifications 3–5 as sections
-- 3–5 of the circular; the comments use the page's numbering.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 =
-- 1, June 2012 = 10).

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2011/12 at one employer, as far as section 1 asks about it.
DECLARE `havraa year at an employer` HAS
    `years of teaching seniority`        IS A NUMBER @desc counted with the year being served (the first year is 1)
    `position at this employer`          IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held at this employer that year (1 = one full position)
    `position at all employers`          IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held at all employers together
    `months worked`                      IS A NUMBER @desc months of work in the school year
    `reform terms`                       IS A `reform terms` @desc the terms the employee is employed on, for the position limit

DECLARE `havraa action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the recuperation allowance` HAS `havraa paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond the position limit`

§§ `1 קצובת דמי הבראה`

@desc The terms a teaching employee is employed on, as section 1 divides them for the position limit.
DECLARE `reform terms` IS ONE OF
    `not under the reform`
    `Oz LaTmura in partial implementation`
    `Oz LaTmura in full implementation`

@ref akn:art_1/p2
`the recuperation-day price` MEANS 420

-- Section 1's table as printed; it has no overlap and no hole from year 1.
@ref akn:art_1/p3 akn:art_1/p4 akn:art_1/p5 akn:art_1/p6 akn:art_1/p7 akn:art_1/p8 akn:art_1/p9 akn:art_1/p10
DECLARE `havraa days band` HAS
    `from havraa year` IS A NUMBER
    `to havraa year`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `havraa band days` IS A NUMBER

`the table of recuperation days` MEANS
    LIST `havraa days band` 1  3   7,
         `havraa days band` 4  10  9,
         `havraa days band` 11 15  10,
         `havraa days band` 16 19  11,
         `havraa days band` 20 24  12,
         `havraa days band` 25 999 13

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `havraa days band`
DECIDE `the bands for year` n IS
    filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from havraa year` AND n AT MOST b's `to havraa year`)
           `the table of recuperation days`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation days for year` n IS
    sum (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `havraa band days`) (`the bands for year` n))

#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the bands for year` n) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 3, 4, 10, 11, 15, 16, 19, 20, 24, 25, 40)

-- Section 1: pro-rated to the part-time position "(1/10 for each month of
-- work)". F-2011-12_tashab_12-a: a year has twelve months and the literal
-- tenths exceed the position. The reading adopted: the position share,
-- counted over at most ten months.
-- No more than one full position; where the positions at several employers
-- total more than 100%, each employer pays the share of the position held
-- with it. F-2011-12_tashab_12-d: the two sentences give a teacher at two
-- employers different totals. The reading adopted: the one-position cap is
-- read per employer, the multi-employer sentence being the specific rule.
@ref akn:art_1/p11 akn:art_1/p12 akn:art_1/p13 akn:art_1/p14 akn:art_1/p15 akn:art_1/p16
GIVEN h IS A `havraa year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa share at this employer` h IS
    min (h's `position at this employer`) 1
    TIMES (min (h's `months worked`) 10 DIVIDED BY 10)

GIVEN h IS A `havraa year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share by literal tenths` h IS
    min (h's `position at this employer`) 1
    TIMES (h's `months worked` DIVIDED BY 10)

@export default The recuperation allowance one employer pays a teaching employee with the June 2012 salary under circular תשע"ב/12
GIVEN h IS A `havraa year at an employer` @desc the employee's school year 2011/12 at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the recuperation allowance` h IS
    `recuperation days for year` (h's `years of teaching seniority`)
    TIMES `the recuperation-day price`
    TIMES `the havraa share at this employer` h

@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN h IS A `havraa year at an employer`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `paying the allowance with June's salary` h IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the recuperation allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the recuperation allowance` h
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 1: the allowance is paid in full with the June 2012 salary"

-- Section 1's limits at all employers together: 140% not under the
-- reform, 130% in partial and 125% in full Oz LaTmura; the rules above are
-- no permission to employ beyond them. Time in months of the year.
@ref akn:art_1/p17 akn:art_1/p18 akn:art_1/p19
GIVEN t IS A `reform terms`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position limit for` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `not under the reform` THEN 1.4
    WHEN `Oz LaTmura in partial implementation` THEN 1.3
    WHEN `Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25

@ref akn:art_1/p20
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `the position limit` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    SHANT `work beyond the position limit`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section 1: no teaching employee works beyond 140%, 130% or 125% of a position at all employers together"

GIVEN h IS A `havraa year at an employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the position limit` h IF
    h's `position at all employers` AT MOST `the position limit for` (h's `reform terms`)

`a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` MEANS
    `havraa year at an employer` WITH
        `years of teaching seniority` IS 22
        `position at this employer`   IS 0.5
        `position at all employers`   IS 0.5
        `months worked`               IS 12
        `reform terms`                IS `not under the reform`

`the literal tenths give more than the position` MEANS
    `the share by literal tenths` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months`
    GREATER THAN `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months`'s `position at this employer`
#ASSERT `the literal tenths give more than the position`

#ASSERT `the recuperation allowance` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` EQUALS 2520

`a teacher at two employers, 0.8 here` MEANS
    `havraa year at an employer` WITH
        `years of teaching seniority` IS 5
        `position at this employer`   IS 0.8
        `position at all employers`   IS 1.4
        `months worked`               IS 10
        `reform terms`                IS `Oz LaTmura in full implementation`

#ASSERT `the recuperation allowance` `a teacher at two employers, 0.8 here` EQUALS 3024
#ASSERT NOT `within the position limit` `a teacher at two employers, 0.8 here`

`the same teacher's other employer, 0.6 there` MEANS
    `havraa year at an employer` WITH
        `years of teaching seniority` IS 5
        `position at this employer`   IS 0.6
        `position at all employers`   IS 1.4
        `months worked`               IS 10
        `reform terms`                IS `Oz LaTmura in full implementation`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_12-d: by the multi-employer sentence the two employers
-- together pay 1.4 positions' allowance; the sentence before it allows "one
-- full position only" to a teacher employed beyond a full position.
`the employers together pay more than one full position's allowance` MEANS
    (`the havraa share at this employer` `a teacher at two employers, 0.8 here`
     PLUS `the havraa share at this employer` `the same teacher's other employer, 0.6 there`)
    GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `the employers together pay more than one full position's allowance`

§§ `2 תשלום מענק יובל`

@desc The stage of education a portion of employment is in, as clarifications 3 and 4 divide it.
DECLARE `education stage` IS ONE OF
    `a middle or upper division`
    `another stage of education`

@desc One portion of a teaching employee's employment, for the jubilee grant.
DECLARE `jubilee portion` HAS
    `stage`                              IS AN `education stage`
    `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS A NUMBER @desc years, as set in the September before the grant, military service included
    `teaching seniority completed on 1 June of the grant year` IS A NUMBER @desc years of accumulated teaching seniority, military service included, completed on 1 June
    `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS A NUMBER @desc years of work in Israel completed on 1 June, compulsory IDF service included
    `determining salary`                 IS A NUMBER @desc the salary of the portion determining pension and severance, without one-off yearly payments such as clothing and havraa; shekels
    `jubilee position fraction`          IS A NUMBER
    `share of the year employed`         IS A NUMBER @desc the fraction of the year the employee was employed

-- Clarifications 3 and 4 (corpus sections 3 and 4): 25 years for the part
-- of the employment in a middle or upper division, 30 for the other stages.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_4
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the qualifying years for` j IS
    CONSIDER j's `stage`
    WHEN `a middle or upper division` THEN 25
    WHEN `another stage of education` THEN 30

-- Section 2: 25 or 30 years and up of teaching seniority, "according to the
-- seniority set in September of the year before the grant"; clarification 2:
-- 25 or 30 years of work in Israel completed on 1 June of the year
-- (F-2011-12_tashab_12-b, -c). Clarification 1 (an unpaid-leave year for
-- which pension rights were bought counts) is part of how the seniority
-- input is counted.
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/p5 akn:art_2/p6 akn:art_2__para_1
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant by section 2` j IF
    j's `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` AT LEAST `the qualifying years for` j

@ref akn:art_2__para_2
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification 2` j IF
    j's `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year` AT LEAST `the qualifying years for` j

-- The reading adopted (F-2011-12_tashab_12-b, -c): clarification 2, the
-- later and more specific clause, decides the date (1 June of the grant
-- year); the measure is section 2's accumulated teaching seniority, which
-- clarifications 3 and 4 call "ותק מצטבר, כהגדרתו לעיל".
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant` j IF
    j's `teaching seniority completed on 1 June of the grant year` AT LEAST `the qualifying years for` j

`an upper-division teacher reaching 25 years between September and June` MEANS
    `jubilee portion` WITH
        `stage`                              IS `a middle or upper division`
        `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS 24
        `teaching seniority completed on 1 June of the grant year` IS 25
        `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS 25
        `determining salary`                 IS 10000
        `jubilee position fraction`          IS 1
        `share of the year employed`         IS 1

`section 2 and clarification 2 date the seniority differently` MEANS
    NOT (`entitled to the jubilee grant by section 2` `an upper-division teacher reaching 25 years between September and June`
         EQUALS `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification 2` `an upper-division teacher reaching 25 years between September and June`)
#ASSERT `section 2 and clarification 2 date the seniority differently`

`a primary-stage teacher with ten years of other work in Israel` MEANS
    `jubilee portion` WITH
        `stage`                              IS `another stage of education`
        `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS 20
        `teaching seniority completed on 1 June of the grant year` IS 20
        `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS 30
        `determining salary`                 IS 10000
        `jubilee position fraction`          IS 1
        `share of the year employed`         IS 1

`section 2 and clarification 2 count different years` MEANS
        `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification 2` `a primary-stage teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`
    AND NOT `entitled to the jubilee grant by section 2` `a primary-stage teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`
#ASSERT `section 2 and clarification 2 count different years`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the jubilee grant` `a primary-stage teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`

-- Section 2 and clarification 5 (corpus section 5): 60% of the determining
-- salary, by the position that year up to one and by the share of the year
-- employed.
@ref akn:art_2/p3 akn:art_2/p4 akn:art_5
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant` j IS
    IF `entitled to the jubilee grant` j
    THEN j's `determining salary`
         TIMES 0.6
         TIMES min (j's `jubilee position fraction`) 1
         TIMES j's `share of the year employed`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee portion`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` j IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the jubilee grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the jubilee grant` j
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 2: the jubilee grant is paid with the June 2012 salary"

#ASSERT `the jubilee grant` `an upper-division teacher reaching 25 years between September and June` EQUALS 6000

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

#TRACE `paying the allowance with June's salary` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the recuperation allowance` 2520 AT 10
#TRACE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` `an upper-division teacher reaching 25 years between September and June` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the jubilee grant` 6000 AT 11
#TRACE `the position limit` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `work beyond the position limit` AT 3
